[size=6][b]Build Advisor[/b][/size]
An in-game deck-building advisor for Slay the Spire 2. It rates every card, relic and shop item against [b]your current deck[/b] and shows why.

[size=4][b]What it does[/b][/size]
[list]
[*][b]Card rewards[/b] — a ribbon under every card: tier S–D, score 0–100 and the expected change of the win rate against skipping. Hover for the full breakdown.
[*][b]Shop[/b] — ribbons on cards and relics and a purchase plan that fits your gold.
[*][b]Campfire and events[/b] — upgrade, removal, transform and enchant priorities on the deck grid; community win-rate verdicts on event options, including Ancients.
[*][b]Relic choices, potions, map route[/b] — relic ratings, potion advice on the rewards screen, expected damage and HP after each map node with the recommended path.
[*][b]Archetypes[/b] — community winning decks (Spire Codex Pick Coach) or your own manual choice.
[*][b]Co-op[/b] — reads your teammates' decks: protect a fragile teammate, empower an attacker, avoid copying their engine.
[*][b]Run review[/b] at the end of a run.
[/list]

[size=4][b]Where the numbers come from[/b][/size]
Community statistics from [url=https://spire-codex.com/]Spire Codex[/url] plus deck adjustments. The adjustment weights are calibrated on 177,251 runs (1.6 million card rewards) and checked on held-out runs.

[size=4][b]Controls[/b][/size]
The red wax seal [b]BD[/b] at the left edge of the screen or [b]F8[/b] opens the panel. Russian / English, offline mode, optional auto-pick (off by default).

The mod never plays for you and does not change the game's rules. Advice is statistics, not a guarantee.

[size=4][b]Русский[/b][/size]
Советник по сборке колоды: оценивает награды, магазин, реликвии, костёр, события и маршрут с учётом вашей колоды. Метки S–D, оценка 0–100 и п.п. к победе против пропуска; полный разбор при наведении. Панель — печать BD у левого края или F8. Веса поправок откалиброваны на 177 тыс. забегов.

Source code and issues: [url=https://github.com/Tkachov0Vitalii/Build_advisor]GitHub[/url]

[size=4][b]Installation[/b][/size]
Extract the archive into [code]Slay the Spire 2/mods/[/code] — you get [code]mods/build-advisor/build-advisor.dll[/code]. Start the game and choose Modded.

[size=4][b]Установка[/b][/size]
Распакуйте архив в [code]Slay the Spire 2/mods/[/code] — получится [code]mods/build-advisor/build-advisor.dll[/code]. Запустите игру и выберите Modded.
